            "value": "Intravenous immunoglobulin combined with intravenous methylprednisolone versus intravenous immunoglobulin only as induction treatment in chronic inflammatory demyelinating polyradiculoneuropathy: a randomised, double-blind, placebo-controlled, phase 3 study."
